Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(android): add safe ootd calendar outfit drafts

- Add the OOTD month calendar (Sunday-first, thumbnail cells, +N badge, day
  detail) and persistent DraftStore for OOTD and Outfit editors.
- Restore the live OOTD delete entry in the day detail (with confirmation),
  delegating to repo.deleteOotd so wear records and images are cleaned by the
  repository, not by hand.
- Outfit Studio 2.0: larger canvas, transparent FLAT layering, selection-only
  outline and a bottom item/photo dock.
- Keep the live entity id when saving an existing OOTD/Outfit as a draft, and
  garbage-collect draft images on overwrite and on final save through a single
  DraftImageCleanup.cleanupOrphans helper.
