Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(android): add measurement ocr and refresh branding

- Add size-aware MeasurementParser: single-value charts and S/M/L/XL or
  numeric size tables, selecting the preferred size column and leaving
  ambiguous rows unmatched for manual confirmation.
- Keep the on-device OCR confirmation sheet for size charts.
- Redesign the app icon (v3) as a wardrobe doorway + fabric fold: two solid,
  slightly offset vertical panels with a subtle V-fold negative space.
- Include drafts (JSON + referenced images) in complete backups, stay
  backward-compatible with draft-less backups, remap restored draft paths and
  validate optional draft files during directory health checks.
- Add unit tests for link extraction, measurement parsing, calendar math,
  draft persistence and draft-image cleanup.
